  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Green Health Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Korea Foundation for International Healthcare (KOFIH) is offering a grant of USD 100,000 for those who wish to request a Strategy Report on Green Health and two PCPs. The project is expected to last approximately 11 months, starting from September 2023 and ending in July 2024.The Strategy Report will include a review of literature on Green Health ODA projects, national policies, and strategies related to green and health ODA in developing countries. The ODA project ideas that arise from the report will be converted into PCPs, and the target countries for these PCPs will be determined after discussions with KOFIH once the strategy report is finished.</narrative>
  </description>
